<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53968" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταζεύγ-νῡμι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταζευγ-νύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yoke together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἅρματα κ. σθένος ἵππιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο πλοῖα
			κατεζευγμένα</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χελώνας -μένας</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.85
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>to be united</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς πρῶτον οὕτω καταζευγνυμέναις
					πόλεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					753e
				</span></i>
			; of marriage, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be straitened, confined</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἀναγκαίης κατέζευχθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τυμβήρει θαλάμῳ κατεζεύχθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					947
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of a right angle, <i>to be made acute</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἂν μικρῷ τινι μᾶλλον κατεζευγμένη
					ᾖ ἡ εὐθεῖα γωνία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Asp.
					<u>in EN</u>
					19.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>fix one's quarters, halt, encamp</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς δυνάμεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.95.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
